I (2781654) sentry:   ota update [beta]            - update to stable (or beta) [login]
I (2781664) sentry:   ota install <X.Y.Z> [force]  - install exact version (force - allow downgrade) [login]
I (2781674) sentry:   ota broken                   - install broken build (rollback test) [login]
I (2781684) sentry:   ota rollback                 - boot previous firmware [login]
I (2781694) sentry:   ota url <url> [force]        - install image from any http(s) link [login]
I (2781694) sentry:   ota server [<url>|default]   - show / set update server (default - GitHub) [login]
I (2781704) sentry: Beacon light (alias: beacon):
