I (2781734) sentry:   lamp brightness <0-100>      - brightness, % [login]
I (2781744) sentry:   lamp mode <mode>             - solid | blink | breathe | rainbow [login]
I (2781754) sentry:   lamp timer <sec>             - auto-off 1-3600 s (0 - cancel) [login]
I (2781754) sentry:   lamp scene save|load <1-3>   - save / load lamp preset [login]
I (2781764) sentry: Trim valve (alias: valve, open|close):
I (2781774) sentry:   relay on|off|toggle          - relay + indicator diode [login]
I (2781774) sentry:   relay status                 - state, auto mode, switch counter [login]
I (2781784) sentry:   relay pulse <ms>             - turn on for 100-10000 ms [login]
I (2781794) sentry:   relay schedule <on> <off>    - cycle on/off in seconds ('off' - stop) [login]
I (2781804) sentry:   relay auto on|off            - turn relay on by distance alarm [login]
I (2781814) sentry:   relay health                 - contact wear and coil check [login]
I (2781814) sentry: Active sonar (alias: sonar):
